                  <div class="row align-items-stretch"><div class="col-lg-6 d-flex">    <div class="card news-card">        <div class="card-img-top-small" style="background-image: url(https://www.sfccmo.edu/news/images/Dr.-Bates-Featured.jpg);">        </div>        <div class="card-body">            <h6 role="presentation">SFCC to Honor Retiring President Dr. Brent Bates at Public Luncheon</h6>            <p>State Fair Community College invites students, employees and community members to celebrate the career and contributions of President Dr. Brent Ba...</p>            <a href="/news/2028-11-18-sfcc-to-honor-retiring-president-dr-brent-bates-at-public-luncheon.php" class="arrow-link">Read More</a>        </div>    </div></div><div class="col-lg-6 d-flex">    <div class="card news-card">        <div class="card-img-top-small" style="background-image: url(https://www.sfccmo.edu/news/images/sfcc-mou-nov26.jpg);">        </div>        <div class="card-body">            <h6 role="presentation">SFCC, Pettis County Sign Agreement to Strengthen Workforce and Economic Development </h6>            <p>State Fair Community College and Pettis County have signed a memorandum of understanding (MOU) establishing a framework for expanded collaboration...</p>            <a href="/news/2026-11-17-sfcc-pettis-county-sign-agreement-to-strengthen-workforce-and-economic-development.php" class="arrow-link">Read More</a>        </div>    </div></div></div>
